# Keeps the Docker build context to tracked files. The build runs from the repo
# root (`docker build -f frontend/Dockerfile .`), so patterns anchor at the repo
# root and an entry that can appear at any depth carries a `**/` prefix. Every
# entry mirrors an untracked entry in a .gitignore (dependency trees, local
# environment files, build and test output, editor and per-machine tool state),
# plus git history and the harness and docs trees the image never reads. The
# image installs its own dependencies and builds its own output. Keep this file
# in step with the .gitignore files.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Harness and docs the image never reads
.claude
.gaia/local
wiki

# react-router
**/.cache
**/build
**/.react-router

# Editors and OS
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Logs and tool caches
**/logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/.npm
**/.eslintcache

# Testing and Storybook output
**/playwright
**/.playwright/.cache
**/.playwright/output
**/.playwright-cli
**/coverage
**/storybook-static

# Per-machine Claude and GAIA state
**/.claude/agent-memory
**/.claude/worktrees
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
**/.claude/settings.local.json
.gaia/local.bak.*
**/.gaia-backup
**/.gaia-ports
**/.gaia-merge
**/.bats-shards-scratch.*
.serena/cache
.serena/project.local.yml
